{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q415051","formula":"C₁₂H₁₈N₂O₄","hill":"C12H18N2O4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":12.0,"H":18.0,"N":2.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Midodrine","ru":"Мидодрин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Midodrine, sold under the brand name Proamatine among others, is an antihypotensive medication used to treat orthostatic hypotension (low blood pressure when standing) and urinary incontinence. It is taken by mouth. Side effects of midodrine include hypertension (high blood pressure), paresthesia, itching (pruritus), goose bumps, chills, urinary urgency, urinary retention, and urinary frequency.","ru":"Мидодрин — препарат, применяемый при низком кровяном давлении, которое приводит к значительным симптомам. Однако, доказательства пользы мидодрина по состоянию на 2015 год еще не были представлены. Препарат принимают внутрь перорально."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":4195,"mass":254.28,"charge":0,"smiles":"COC1=CC(=C(C=C1)OC)C(CNC(=O)CN)O","inchikey":"PTKSEFOSCHHMPD-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2-amino-N-[2-(2,5-dimethoxyphenyl)-2-hydroxyethyl]acetamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"4195","atoms":36,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.5,"y":0.627,"z":1.985,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.711,"y":-2.535,"z":0.246,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.882,"y":1.922,"z":-0.441,"el":"O"},{"x":3.507,"y":-0.749,"z":-0.994,"el":"O"},{"x":2.609,"y":1.087,"z":0.108,"el":"N"},{"x":6.035,"y":0.234,"z":-0.567,"el":"N"},{"x":0.47,"y":0.028,"z":0.69,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.973,"y":-0.153,"z":0.279,"el":"C"},{"x":1.235,"y":0.904,"z":-0.302,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.484,"y":-1.426,"z":0.08,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.761,"y":0.974,"z":0.108,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.095,"y":0.825,"z":-0.271,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.818,"y":-1.575,"z":-0.299,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.624,"y":-0.45,"z":-0.475,"el":"C"},{"x":3.638,"y":0.239,"z":-0.275,"el":"